<h1>The Winner</h1>

<h2>Ackee Wins!</h2>

<p>
    Ackee wins because it is a popular Jamaican breakfast favourite
    that can be prepared in about 30 minutes. When served with fried
    dumpling, it makes a delicious and satisfying meal. Although curry
    goat is an excellent choice for parties and special occasions,
    ackee is the winner for its shorter cooking time and traditional
    Sunday morning appeal.
</p>

